  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982745/description_edb1d849-fc71-4d6b-b4d2-2c803f721a17.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">Paster Dream</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">歡迎來到……你的夢境！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">這將是你最棒的夢幻之旅……</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">是時候做個甜美的夢了！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><em><strong>遊戲前提示</strong></em></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#f9c\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組仍處於 BETA 測試階段&nbsp;若您遇到問題，請確認當前版本是否為已發布的最新版本，非最新版本的任何問題將不予受理！</span> </span></strong></em></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#f9c\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">國際化（I18N）仍在開發中！</span></span></strong></em></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#f9c\">&nbsp;</span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">歡迎來到 PasterDream，「尋夢者」！PasterDream 將帶您進入一段美妙的夢境故事。<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">那是<em><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><strong>甜美的夢境</strong></span></em>？還是<em><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong>一場噩夢</strong></span></em>？先輩們<em><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">已然消逝</span></strong></em>？抑或隱藏著<em><strong><span style=\"color:#008000\">夢境中未說出口的秘辛</span></strong></em>？</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#f9c\">前去揭開這場夢境的源頭之謎，一旦踏上此途，便無退路。</span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#f9c\">這將是一場偉大的精神遠征，為了你自己，也為了某位曾經的「尋夢者」。</span></strong></em></span><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px\"><strong><br></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px\"><br></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:24px\"><strong>開啟你的夢境</strong></span><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px\"><br></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">在探索世界的過程中，你將發現一些脫離現實的自然奇觀。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">滿足你的好奇心，去發現並探索它們，並在隨睡眠而來的夢境中與<strong>「那處所在」</strong>產生共鳴。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/AmarokIce/main/img/PasterDream/Main.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1563\" height=\"852\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/AmarokIce/main/img/PasterDream/StartYourDream.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>探索</strong> </span><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><br></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">探索你的夢境，發現寶藏、遺跡與魔法秘辛</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">尋找「尋夢者」先輩們留下的歷史足跡，或是探索大自然未知的奇觀。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">祖先留下了許多故事，如今，你將用雙腳寫下自己的篇章。去發掘那些故事，並記錄屬於你的傳奇。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/AmarokIce/main/img/PasterDream/Main.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/AmarokIce/main/img/PasterDream/Exploration.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>戰鬥</strong> </span><br></span></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">相較於傳統武器與裝備，每件特殊裝備都擁有獨特的被動效果、戰鬥技能與套裝加成。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">「瞬間」技能讓戰鬥更加靈活多變。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">更多的裝飾性物品、脫離現實的法術系統以及多樣化的戰鬥組合，將成為應對後續噩夢的必要條件。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/AmarokIce/main/img/PasterDream/Combat .png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>暗影之下</strong></span></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">曾經繁榮的城市如今淪為廢墟，儘管守衛者為抵禦入侵者付出了慘痛代價，卻仍無法阻止文明的衰亡。<br>作為最後的抵抗者，他們選擇與古城一同長眠於黑暗之中，但無盡的憤怒與仇恨即便在沉睡中也無法平息，反而在這片黑暗中不斷醞釀，隨著歲月流逝變得日益瘋狂。<br>接受吧，屈服吧，我們只能依靠這無盡的黑暗！與光明截然相反的暗面，才能讓我們真正守護這片故土！<br><strong>亞倫科斯（Aaroncos）</strong>……請允許我們再次向您請求，我們已無法回頭……</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/AmarokIce/main/img/PasterDream/Sprite-0004.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#396;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>風之旅程</strong></span></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#396;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>「尋夢者」</strong>們已經發現了新的夢境，就在我們仰望的天空之上……</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#396\">常規的建築無法將我們帶往高空，或許我們可以借助風的力量，展開全新的旅程。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#396;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/AmarokIce/main/img/PasterDream/Wind.png\"></span></p>",
